  "instructions": [
    "place a wheat leaf wrap in a bamboo tray lined with parchment paper.",
    "arrange 4 dried dates in the center of the leaf wrap.",
    "place 60g of epoisses cheese on top of the dates.",
    "drizzle 1 tbsp of honey over the cheese.",
    "sprinkle a pinch of cinnamon and cardamom over the honey.",
    "fold the leaf wrap to enclose the filling.",
    "secure with a toothpick if necessary.",
    "steam the wrap in a bamboo steamer for 2 minutes.",
    "serve warm, garnished with chopped fresh parsley."
